# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# DocuMind AI — Backend Environment Variables
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values.
# Generate a secure SECRET_KEY with:
#   python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(64))"

# ── Environment Mode ─────────────────
# Values: development, production, testing
ENVIRONMENT=development

# ── Database (Required) ──────────────
# Local:       postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/documind_ai
# Neon (prod): postgresql://user:password@ep-xxx.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/documind_ai?sslmode=require
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/documind_ai

# ── Security (Required) ─────────────
# Must be at least 32 characters. Use a cryptographically random value.
SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key-here-must-be-at-least-32-characters
ALGORITHM=HS256
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=30

# ── Cookie Configuration ─────────────
# COOKIE_SECURE: Set to False for local dev (HTTP). Defaults to True (requires HTTPS).
# COOKIE_SAMESITE: "strict", "lax", or "none". Use "lax" for cross-origin deployments.
# COOKIE_DOMAIN: Leave empty for same-origin. Set to ".yourdomain.com" for subdomains.
COOKIE_SECURE=False
COOKIE_SAMESITE=lax
# COOKIE_DOMAIN=

# ── AI / LLM (Multi-Provider LLM Configuration) ──────
# LLM_PROVIDER: ollama (default), groq, gemini, claude
LLM_PROVIDER=ollama

# Ollama Configuration (Local Development)
OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434
OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen3:8b

# Groq Configuration (Production option)
# Requires GROQ_API_KEY if LLM_PROVIDER=groq
# GROQ_API_KEY=your-groq-api-key-here
# GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-specdec

# Google Gemini Configuration (Production option)
# Requires GEMINI_API_KEY if LLM_PROVIDER=gemini
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash

# Anthropic Claude Configuration (Production option)
# Requires ANTHROPIC_API_KEY if LLM_PROVIDER=claude
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key-here
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022

# ====================================================
# Embedding Provider Configuration
# ====================================================
#
# EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=local
#
# Supported values:
#   local
#   gemini
#
# ── local ─────────────────────────────────────────────
#   Requires:     pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
#   Uses:         Sentence Transformers (runs locally)
#   Default model: BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5
#
# ── gemini ────────────────────────────────────────────
#   Requires:     pip install -r requirements.txt
#   Requires:     GEMINI_API_KEY (set below or in AI/LLM section)
#   Uses:         Google Gemini Embedding API
#   Default model: text-embedding-004
#
# ====================================================

EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=local

# Local embedding model (used when EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=local)
EMBEDDING_MODEL=BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5

# Gemini embedding model (used when EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=gemini)
# GEMINI_EMBEDDING_MODEL=text-embedding-004

# ── Upload ────────────────────────────
# UPLOAD_DIR=./uploads
# MAX_UPLOAD_SIZE_MB=50

# ── ChromaDB (Vector Store) ──────────
# CHROMA_DB_PATH=./chroma

# ── CORS ──────────────────────────────
# Override default origins (JSON array format)
# Development default: ["http://localhost:3000","http://127.0.0.1:3000"]
# Production example:  ["https://your-app.vercel.app"]
# CORS_ORIGINS=["http://localhost:3000","http://127.0.0.1:3000"]

# ── Google OAuth ──────────────────────
# Required in production. Get from https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
